  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.Selected>Вибрано</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.Selected>
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.CannotAssignReason>неможливо призначити: {0}</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.CannotAssignReason>

